# What the repository checks out, on any machine.
#
# The scripts shipped with the agent files are run by a shell; one checked out
# with CRLF fails under Cygwin or MSYS with `$'\r': command not found`. The
# same four lines go into every project `Copy Agent Spec to Workspace` touches
# (assets/agent/gitattributes).

* text=auto

*.sh      text eol=lf
*.bash    text eol=lf
Makefile  text eol=lf
*.mk      text eol=lf
*.mjs     text eol=lf

*.vcd     -text
*.vsix    binary
*.pdf     binary
